# Ron on the fourth riichi discard (engine.md §4.1 rows 1/3/5, §4.2, rules.md §4.24).
# Seats 0, 1, 2 each declare riichi (3 sticks accepted).
# Seat 3 declares the 4th riichi and discards 7s -> Seat 0 rons 7s!
# Row 1 (Ron) overrides Row 3 (reach_accepted) and Row 5 (suucha_riichi):
# Seat 3 pays NO riichi stick and the round ends by ron, not abortive draw.
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + ron 7s (dora ind 1z -> dora 2z; ura ind 1z -> ura 2z)
#   Yaku: double_riichi (2) + ippatsu (1) + pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 5 han (Mangan)
#   Dealer ron = 12000 from Seat 3 + 3 sticks on table (3000) - own 1000 stick = +14000 net.
#   Seat 1: -1000, Seat 2: -1000, Seat 3: -12000 (no 4th stick paid!).

[meta]
name: suucha_riichi_discard_ron
title: Ron on the fourth riichi discard wins without accepting the fourth stick or aborting
rules: mahjongsoul
source: engine.md §4.1 rows 1/3/5, §4.2, rules.md §4.24

